        "content": "**Section Purpose (Phase 2 – Human Conversation Handling):**  \nThis section manages the transition from AI to human support. Once a human is active, all user messages are routed to Discord, and AI responses are paused to avoid collision.\n\n**Step-by-step Flow:**  \n• Retrieves the latest conversation record from Supabase using **session_id** to check the current state  \n• Extracts and normalizes required fields so downstream nodes work with clean, predictable data  \n• Evaluates whether **human_active** is set to true, which indicates a human takeover  \n• If human support is active, forwards the user’s message to the correct Discord thread  \n• Waits in real time for a response from a Figmenta team member on Discord  \n• Captures and formats the human reply so it can be sent back to the web chat UI  \n\n**State & Safety Handling:**  \n• Ensures the AI does not respond while a human is engaged  \n• Maintains a single source of truth via Supabase for conversation state  \n• Prevents message duplication or race conditions between AI and human replies  \n\n**Outcome:**  \nProvides a seamless, real-time human chat experience while keeping the web chat, Discord, and database fully synchronized.\n",
        "height": 448,
        "width": 672,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -752,
        64
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "5e99429a-fc78-4773-852b-2b36b1a8e2f0",
      "name": "Sticky Note9"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Section Purpose (AI Agent – Phase 1 Discovery Engine):**  \nThis section powers Fig1, the AI assistant responsible for leading the conversation, answering Figmenta-related questions, and systematically collecting discovery information before any human escalation.\n\n**Core Responsibilities:**  \n• Acts as the first-line assistant for all incoming user messages  \n• Maintains a natural, guided conversation while keeping control of the flow  \n• Proactively asks discovery questions in a fixed order (project type, brand name, industry, budget, timeline)  \n• Allows users to skip or decline questions without breaking the flow  \n\n**Knowledge & Reasoning:**  \n• Uses the Figmenta Knowledge Base (vector search) to answer company, service, and capability questions  \n• Falls back to escalation when a query goes outside the knowledge scope  \n• Relies on OpenAI Chat Model for reasoning and response generation  \n\n**State & Memory Handling:**  \n• Uses session-based memory to preserve short-term context and avoid repetition  \n• Extracts structured data from free-form user replies  \n• Updates Supabase in real time to store collected discovery fields and conversation state  \n\n**Escalation Logic:**  \n• Detects when discovery is complete or when human assistance is required  \n• Triggers Discord thread creation when the user chooses to talk to a human  \n• Hands off control cleanly by updating `human_active` to prevent AI response collisions  \n\n**Outcome:**  \nDelivers a controlled, informative, and human-like discovery experience while ensuring the conversation remains state-driven, scalable, and ready for seamless human takeover.\n",
        "height": 656,
        "width": 704,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -768,
        944
      ],
