      "name": "Sticky Note12"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Section Purpose (Knowledge Base Ingestion):**  \nThis section builds and maintains Figmenta’s AI knowledge base by converting company documents into searchable vector embeddings.\n\n**How it works:**  \n• Downloads the source PDF files containing Figmenta’s official information  \n• Uses a document loader to split and preprocess the content into readable chunks  \n• Generates vector embeddings using OpenAI Embeddings  \n• Stores the embedded documents in Supabase Vector Store  \n\n**Why this matters:**  \n• Allows the AI Agent to answer questions accurately using verified company data  \n• Prevents hallucinations by grounding responses in real documents  \n• Enables semantic search instead of keyword-based matching  \n\n**Outcome:**  \nCreates a reliable, scalable knowledge base that the AI Agent can query in real time during conversations.\n",
